   2   2│line2    ┃   2   2│line2
   3    │line3    ┃   3    │line3
+      3│backport3┃+      3│upstream3
   4   4│line4    ┃   4   4│line4
   5   5│         ┃   5   5│
   6   6│line6    ┃   6   6│line6
-  7    │line7    ┃-  7    │other7
+      7│backport7┃+      7│upstream7
